  "implementedFixes": [
    "Line-free surface hierarchy: canvas #F2F6FC, white web panels, screen-flat mobile panels",
    "Signal/action/selection semantics separated for Badge, Button, QuickFilter and Card",
    "Desktop typography normalized to 24/20/18/16/14/12 through consumer override",
    "Desktop control tiers normalized to 32 small / 36 standard / 40 row / 56 topbar",
    "Mobile controls remain 44px with 44px minimum touch target",
    "Spacing uses 4/8/12/16/20/24/32 scale; shared panel padding normalized from 22 to 20",
    "Radius scale remains 4/6/8/pill",
    "Elevation remains 0/base/hover/float",
    "Web shell uses topbar + sidenav + multi-panel workspace + statusbar",
    "Mobile shell has no global topbar and uses panel-first navigation",
    "Internal Admin pages are guarded from page-local visual systems",
    "Panel and Card surfaces separated: canvas #F2F6FC -> panel #FFFFFF -> component/card #F7F9FC",
    "Live product perk detail text normalized from legacy 13px to 14px body scale"
  ],
